<p>Augment your rockets with highly flammable materials, causing them to burn targets for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>steampower 100">90, 121, 145, 165, 183</acronym> fire damage over 3 turns. Subsequent shots against burning targets refresh the effect of the duration (but do not stack) and inflict <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>steampower 100">45, 60, 72, 83, 92</acronym> additional fire damage.</p><p>Targets affected by this burning that fall below 25% life enter a state of panic, giving them a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15%, 20%, 23%, 27%, 30%</acronym> chance each turn to flee in terror from you.</p><p>The fire damage will increase with your Steampower.</p>